  "About" modal, opened from the toolbar menu. Same visual language as
  the library tile context menu (game_context_popup.xml +
  bg_game_context.xml): a 16 dp rounded panel on a dim backdrop, M3
  palette in both light and dark themes. The version line is filled
  from PackageManager (MainActivity.showAboutPopup); tap outside or
  Back dismisses.

